=3D"overall-explanation"><p>Correct option:</p>

<p><strong>Platform as a Service (PaaS)</strong></p>

<p>Cloud Computing can be broadly divided into three types - Infrastructure=
 as a Service (IaaS), Platform as a Service (PaaS), Software as a Service (=
SaaS).</p>

<p>Platform as a Service (PaaS) removes the need to manage underlying infra=
structure (usually hardware and operating systems) and allows you to focus =
on the deployment and management of your applications. You don=E2=80=99t ne=
ed to worry about resource procurement, capacity planning, software mainten=
ance, patching, or any of the other undifferentiated heavy lifting involved=
 in running your application.</p>

