nd roles.</p>

<p><strong>AWS Command Line Interface (CLI)</strong> - The AWS Command Line=
 Interface (CLI) is a unified tool to manage your AWS services. With just o=
ne tool to download and configure, you can control multiple AWS services fr=
om the command line and automate them through scripts. It is not a central =
user portal.</p>

