ce container orchestration service that supports Docker containers and allo=
ws you to easily run and scale containerized applications on AWS. Amazon EC=
S eliminates the need for you to install and operate your own container orc=
hestration software, manage and scale a cluster of virtual machines, or sch=
edule containers on those virtual machines. Using Amazon ECS requires exper=
ience.</p>

