ng business processes to fit the new system. Since the scenario specifies n=
o changes to the application, this strategy is not applicable.</p>

<p><strong>Replatform</strong> - Replatforming, or "lift, tinker, and shift=
," involves moving the application to the cloud with minor modifications to=
