atabase to Amazon RDS). While it preserves most of the architecture, some c=
hanges are still made. Since the question specifies that no changes are to =
be made, replatforming is not the best fit.</p>

<p><strong>Refactor</strong> - Refactoring (also called re-architecting) in=
volves modifying or re-writing parts of the application to take advantage o=
f cloud-native features like serverless architecture, microservices, or con=
tainers. This option requires the most effort and time. Since the company i=
n the scenario wants no changes, refactoring is not suitable.</p>

