<p><strong>People perspective</strong> - The People perspective focuses on =
organizational culture, workforce transformation, leadership, and cloud ski=
lls. It helps organizations prepare employees and teams for successful clou=
d adoption.</p>

<p>Strategy management does not belong to the People perspective. The Busin=
ess perspective addresses strategic business priorities and outcomes.</p>

